      "content": "hey, i'm writing a briefing for a policy group about the green energy transition. can u help me write a strong opening paragraph? i want it to emphasize that while there might be some temporary economic growing pains or higher energy prices, the urgent need to phase out fossil fuels for the sake of the planet has to be the main priority for any government right now. make it sound professional but urgent.",
